    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like such a massive amount of effort just to participate in a lie. everything is so heavy and exhausting, and for what? to just keep spinning around a star until eventually we just... stop? it's hard to see the point in fighting to keep a \"path\" going when the destination is just more nothingness. it feels more logical to just let go of the struggle.",
